{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love hard games, this game is for you! The core mechanic of the game is that the level darkens when you move so that every obstacle in the level gets hidden! Once you stop moving, the level reveals again. Now you might be thinking, what if you move/stop so fast that it feels like a flicker movement to cheat the game, well... you are limited on the amount of light you have per level\u00a0\ud83d\ude08 Meaning that if you move/stop too much, you will run out of light and continue the level in total darkness\u00a0\ud83d\ude08</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/skulls_halloween_new_35_optimize.gif?t=1745227265\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can check the gameplay trailer above to see a glimpse of what you will face in this game\u2620\ufe0f Am developing this game on my own, would appreciate smashing that Wishlist button if you like the game\ud83d\ude0e</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3055110?t=1745227265","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/358321a176ee584f90c22823d7b1cfeee795bf86/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745227265","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/2f20ba66dea88e9c3c310fb400648469b479b2f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745227265","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/2f20ba66dea88e9c3c310fb400648469b479b2f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745227265","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love hard games, this game is for you! The core mechanic of the game is that the level darkens